                <td style="height: 99.6667px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Tenofovir 300 mg PO daily</p>
<p>Emtricitabine 200 mg PO daily, plus raltegravir 400 mg PO twice daily or dolutegravir 50 mg PO twice daily</p>
